{"title":"Black Walnut Staff","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Bowyer Lv 45) · Monster drop: Vanguard Captain Mhorsk, Ogre Shaman, Werewolf, Highwayman, Withered Husk +4 more</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-req\"><b>Requires</b> Lvl 25 · DEX 70 <span class=\"muted\">to equip</span></p>\n      <h2>Skill needed</h2><p>Any class can cast with a staff, using a spell it has learned. Each school of magic is a skill of its own: see <a href=\"#/guide/magic\">Magic</a> for the schools and where spell scrolls drop.</p>\n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Bowyer at level 45 <span class=\"muted\">(4160 XP)</span> from 8× <a href=\"#/item/black-walnut-wood\">Black Walnut Wood</a>, 8× <a href=\"#/item/wool\">Wool</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"sapling-treant\" title=\"Sapling Treant - dropped it in 1 of 13 looted corpses (1/13)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/1e5337fd4c7c8220dcbc.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Sapling Treant</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/13<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"elder-briar-warden\" title=\"Elder Briar Warden - dropped it in 1 of 14 looted corpses (1/14)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/3281b5fe47b789f85acb.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Elder Briar Warden</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/14<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"highwayman\" title=\"Highwayman - dropped it in 2 of 32 looted corpses (1/16)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/01bd8b56b2a034105292.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Highwayman</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/16<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\